nterface for finite-validity discussion, p.22 scan37"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-godel-numbering-—-Gödel编码-$\\ulcorner-\\cdot-\\urcorner$\">df-godel-numbering — Gödel编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(d_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(d_t)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(d_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(d_t)}\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau=\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau\\sqcup\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau=\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau\\sqcup\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span> 保留项/公式类型标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\">\\(\\bar a\\)</span> 为有限自然数序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 为空序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau\">\\(b_\\tau\\)</span> 按有限语法树严格子树递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seqcode}\">\\(\\operatorname{seqcode}\\)</span> 按序列长度递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的定义域在两个编码类中分别是全部语法树和句子；省略项/公式的外层类型标签只用于书写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(t)\">\\(b_\\tau(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(\\varphi)\">\\(b_\\tau(\\varphi)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1,\\qquad\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle a\\rangle\\Vert\\bar b)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{pair}(a,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\bar b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1,\\qquad\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle a\\rangle\\Vert\\bar b)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{pair}(a,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\bar b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(x_i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(0,i),\\qquad b_\\tau(c_j)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(1,j),\\qquad b_\\tau(f_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{d_j}))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(2,\\operatorname{pair}(j,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle b_\\tau(t_1),\\ldots,b_\\tau(t_{d_j})\\rangle))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_\\tau(x_i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(0,i),\\qquad b_\\tau(c_j)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(1,j),\\qquad b_\\tau(f_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{d_j}))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(2,\\operatorname{pair}(j,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle b_\\tau(t_1),\\ldots,b_\\tau(t_{d_j})\\rangle))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(3,0),\\qquad b_\\tau(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(4,0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_\\tau(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(3,0),\\qquad b_\\tau(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(4,0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(t=u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(5,\\operatorname{pair}(b_\\tau(t),b_\\tau(u))),\\qquad b_\\tau(R_j(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(6,\\operatorname{pair}(j,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle b_\\tau(t_1),\\ldots,b_\\tau(t_{a_j})\\rangle))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_\\tau(t=u)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(5,\\operatorname{pair}(b_\\tau(t),b_\\tau(u))),\\qquad b_\\tau(R_j(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(6,\\operatorname{pair}(j,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle b_\\tau(t_1),\\ldots,b_\\tau(t_{a_j})\\rangle))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(7,b_\\tau(\\varphi)),\\quad\\kappa(\\land)\\coloneqq0,\\ \\kappa(\\lor)\\coloneqq1,\\ \\kappa(\\to)\\coloneqq2,\\ \\kappa(\\leftrightarrow)\\coloneqq3,\\quad\\lambda(\\exists)\\coloneqq0,\\ \\lambda(\\forall)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_\\tau(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(7,b_\\tau(\\varphi)),\\quad\\kappa(\\land)\\coloneqq0,\\ \\kappa(\\lor)\\coloneqq1,\\ \\kappa(\\to)\\coloneqq2,\\ \\kappa(\\leftrightarrow)\\coloneqq3,\\quad\\lambda(\\exists)\\coloneqq0,\\ \\lambda(\\forall)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(8,\\operatorname{pair}(\\kappa(\\circ),\\operatorname{pair}(b_\\tau(\\varphi),b_\\tau(\\psi)))),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_\\tau(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(8,\\operatorname{pair}(\\kappa(\\circ),\\operatorname{pair}(b_\\tau(\\varphi),b_\\tau(\\psi)))),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau(Qx_i\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(9,\\operatorname{pair}(\\lambda(Q),\\operatorname{pair}(i,b_\\tau(\\varphi)))),\\quad Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_\\tau(Qx_i\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(9,\\operatorname{pair}(\\lambda(Q),\\operatorname{pair}(i,b_\\tau(\\varphi)))),\\quad Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_\\tau:\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{rng}(b_\\tau)\\in\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N},\\qquad b_\\tau[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau]\\in\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_\\tau:\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{rng}(b_\\tau)\\in\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N},\\qquad b_\\tau[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau]\\in\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{g:\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists u,v\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau\\;(g(s)=u(b_\\tau(s))\\land v(g(s))=b_\\tau(s))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{g:\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists u,v\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau\\;(g(s)=u(b_\\tau(s))\\land v(g(s))=b_\\tau(s))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{g:\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists u,v\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(g(\\varphi)=u(b_\\tau(\\varphi))\\land v(g(\\varphi))=b_\\tau(\\varphi))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{g:\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists u,v\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(g(\\varphi)=u(b_\\tau(\\varphi))\\land v(g(\\varphi))=b_\\tau(\\varphi))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(\\varphi),\\quad (g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau)\\lor(g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(\\tau)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(\\varphi),\\quad (g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau)\\lor(g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(\\tau)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文件把基本树编码和原始递归函数类作为外部原语。本条给出带构造子标签的实际编码；自然数配对的逆由对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 提取2的幂次得到，列表和子树解码向较小代码递归。项与公式的标签互不相交，关系及函数元数在解码时由有限词汇检查，因此合法代码及句子代码均可判定。</p>\n<p>保留原 GNum 的原始递归互译要求，同时为原完备性条目中较一般的“有效句子编码”单列 EffSentCode；这没有把一般可计算编码偷偷加强成原始递归编码。两种代码类都指定定义域；有限证明所用的句子列表代码使用同一 seqcode。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-godel-numbering-—-Gödel编码-$\\ulcorner-\\cdot-\\urcorner$","text":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel编码 $\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-computability","status":"resolved","id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-computability]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(d_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(d_t)}\\rangle$ 为有限词汇；$\\mathrm{Syn}_\\tau=\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau\\sqcup\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau$ 保留项/公式类型标签